1133 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Senior Product\240Designer  \042  IBM \024 Cloud\054 Digital Business Group\nJan 2014 \023 Feb 2020\nSenior IC designer for IBM Cloud\047s enterprise SaaS DevTools portfolio\054 defining product direction and improving developer and DevOps experiences as a player\055coach\056 Coordinated team workload and stakeholder communication while owning IC deliverables\056\nReversed failing adoption of DevOps Insights\054 an enterprise SaaS developer experience tool for IBM Cloud\056 Diagnosed UX failure\054 pivoted strategy\054 and redesigned the core entry experience\054 driving 4x user growth \0501\054750 \222 7\054000\051 and 4x monthly visitors in 60 days\056\nShipped IBM\031s first self\055service SaaS marketplace\056\nShipped Provider Workbench\054 the back\055end system that enabled internal and partner SaaS products to be onboarded and managed for our digital marketplace\056\nFacilitated dozens of Design Thinking workshops with enterprise clients\054 cross\055functional stakeholders\054 and community leaders\056\nVisual Designer  \042  Zappos \024 SiteOps\054 6PM\nNov 2012 \023 Dec 2013\nProduced web and print marketing assets for Zappos and 6pm\054 art\055directing photoshoots and collaborating with high\055performing brands \050e\056g\056\054 Ugg\051 on seasonal campaigns\056)
     /K [ 0 ]
     /P 1134 0 R
     /Pg 1130 0 R
