1141 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Professional summary\nPrincipal\055level Product Designer with 13 years shipping consumer and enterprise products at Microsoft and IBM\056 Specialist in designing for scale \050multi\055surface\054 multi\055audience platforms serving tens of millions of users\051 with a proven track record of translating behavioral data\054 personalization systems\054 and community mechanics into high\055impact consumer experiences\056 Most recently served as Design Architect at Xbox\054 owning end\055to\055end design across platform experiences and shipping work that moved engagement and revenue metrics measurably\056)
     /K [ 1 ]
     /P 1142 0 R
     /Pg 1132 0 R
